@startuml
title Notificação após operação de empréstimo

participant LendingServiceImpl as LendingService
participant NotificationServiceImpl as NotificationService
participant LendingNotificationFactory as Factory
participant NotificationSenderRegistry as Registry
participant EmailNotificationSender as Email
participant SmsNotificationSender as SMS
participant WebhookNotificationSender as Webhook
participant LoggingNotificationSender as Log

LendingService -> NotificationService : notify(emprestimo, tipo)
NotificationService -> Factory : create(emprestimo, tipo)
Factory --> NotificationService : LendingNotificationEvent
NotificationService -> Registry : selected()
Registry --> NotificationService : canais ativos

loop para cada canal ativo
  alt email com contacto disponível
    NotificationService -> Email : send(event)
    Email --> NotificationService : concluído ou falha isolada
  else SMS com contacto disponível
    NotificationService -> SMS : send(event)
    SMS --> NotificationService : concluído ou falha isolada
  else webhook com consentimento
    NotificationService -> Webhook : send(event)
    Webhook --> NotificationService : concluído ou falha isolada
  else canal log
    NotificationService -> Log : send(event)
    Log --> NotificationService : registado
  end
end

NotificationService --> LendingService : operação mantém-se concluída
@enduml
